[[2047,127,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before removing and refitting\nthe sensor, the following preliminary operations must be carried out:\n- Turn the ignition off &quot;STOP&quot; and remove the key; - Disconnect\nthe battery.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238841\">7040H36</a></p><p>1. Unscrew both retaining bolts.</p><p>2. Withdraw the sensor from the bottom.</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connection and remove the sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Sensor for driver&#x27;s Side Bag</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236617\">K66</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Sensor for passenger Side Bag</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236622\">K67</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018902.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the sensor is not\ndamaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Place the sensor in its seating.</p><p>Tighten the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238841\">7040H36</a></p><p>Connect the battery.</p><p>Check system operation using the Examiner\nor another tester.</p>"]]